    "status": "INDICATIVE - configurable rule set",
    "disclaimer": "Thresholds below reproduce widely used FSSAI / Codex-style claim conventions and typical permitted additive levels. They are stored as editable configuration so a formulation team can align them with the current gazette/regulation for the target market before filing. The system treats them as hard constraints; it does not claim to certify compliance."
